Scope of this license
----------------------
The Apache-2.0 license in this repository covers the original contribution of
this repository: the Lean 4 formalization under BHFormalization/.

The Python reproducibility bundle at the repository root (the *.py scripts,
reproducibility_manifest.json, published_fdr_plan.json, fdr_experiment_results.tex,
and the CSV JSON/ data) is reproduced from Edgar Dobriban's repository
https://github.com/dobriban/BH and remains subject to that project's terms. It
is included here only for convenience and is not an original contribution of
this repository.

Attribution
-----------
The mathematical result formalized here is due to Edgar Dobriban, "The
Benjamini-Hochberg Procedure Can Fail to Control the FDR for Correlated
